<meta name="description" content="Enterprise software vendors are arbitraging open weight models, developing their own options and using the frontier AI labs when needed. Take notes since you&#039;ll likely be doing the same LLM portfolio management as you wrangle your AI budget. The latest round of enterprise software earnings featured a bevy of nuggets on mixing and matching AI models. Since most companies are consuming their AI through their applications it&#039;s worth watching the vendors who are taking on the token cost risks and managing margins with a portfolio approach to models." />
