                <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https://www.constellationr.com/insights/news/why-you-should-arbitrage-your-ai-models-your-vendors-do" target="_blank" title="Share to Linkedin" aria-label="Share to Linkedin" class="social-sharing-buttons-button share-linkedin" rel="noopener">
